Zlib: gzip and deflate files and output compression, with the zlib of
the base system.

The module zlib of PHP 8.4 for php84 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20240924/zlib.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d, its headers in
include/php84/php/ext/zlib.
